	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Lark Docs for Alfred

Keywords:
  ld [query]   Browse recent Feishu docs; type to filter recents and search all of Lark.
  ll           Sign in / refresh the Feishu session (opens Chrome; scan the QR the first time).

Actions on a result:
  ↩   Open in browser
  ⌘↩  Copy link
  ⌥↩  Copy title + link (Markdown)

Requires Node (Homebrew) and Google Chrome. Logic lives in search.mjs / auth.mjs / lib.mjs.</string>
